@startuml 发送图片顺序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "客户端GUI" as GUI
participant "文件处理器" as FileHandler
participant "聊天服务器" as Server
participant "文件服务器" as FileServer
participant "消息存储器" as MessageDB
collections "接收方客户端" as Receivers

== 发送图片流程 ==
User -> GUI: 选择图片
activate GUI

GUI -> FileHandler: 处理图片文件
activate FileHandler
FileHandler -> FileHandler: 压缩图片
FileHandler -> FileHandler: 生成缩略图
FileHandler --> GUI: 返回处理结果

GUI -> FileServer: 上传图片
activate FileServer
FileServer -> FileServer: 存储图片
FileServer --> GUI: 返回图片URL

GUI -> Server: 发送图片消息
activate Server
Server -> MessageDB: 保存消息记录
activate MessageDB
MessageDB --> Server: 保存成功
deactivate MessageDB

alt 接收方在线
    Server -> Receivers: 推送图片消息
    activate Receivers
    Receivers -> FileServer: 请求下载图片
    FileServer --> Receivers: 返回图片数据
    Receivers -> Receivers: 显示图片
    deactivate Receivers
end

Server --> GUI: 发送成功
GUI --> User: 显示发送成功
deactivate GUI

@enduml
